# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION - YouTube Buddy
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── DATABASE CONFIGURATION (PostgreSQL) ──────────────────────────────
POSTGRES_USER=youtube_buddy_user
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=GenerateSecurePassword123!
POSTGRES_DB=youtube_buddy
POSTGRES_HOST=prod-db.rds.amazonaws.com
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://youtube_buddy_user:GenerateSecurePassword123!@prod-db.rds.amazonaws.com:5432/youtube_buddy

# ── CACHE & JOB QUEUE (Redis) ────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://prod-redis.elasticache.amazonaws.com:6379/0
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://prod-redis.elasticache.amazonaws.com:6379/1
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://prod-redis.elasticache.amazonaws.com:6379/2
CELERY_TASK_ALWAYS_EAGER=False

# ── PRIMARY AI PROVIDER: OpenAI (GPT-4, DALL-E, Whisper) ──────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxx
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1
OPENAI_TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL=whisper-1
AI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=120

# ── FALLBACK AI PROVIDER: Ollama (Self-Hosted Local LLM) ──────────────
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3

# ── FREE AI PROVIDER: Google Gemini (15 RPM, 1M tokens/day free) ──────
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
# ── SECONDARY AI PROVIDER: Hugging Face (Image generation, NLP tasks) ─
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=hf_xxxxx
HUGGINGFACE_MODEL=microsoft/DialoGPT-medium
HUGGINGFACE_TEXT_MODEL=microsoft/DialoGPT-medium
HUGGINGFACE_IMAGE_MODEL=stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium
HUGGINGFACE_AUDIO_MODEL=

# ── AUTHENTICATION: Firebase (Google Login, YouTube OAuth) ────────────
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=youtube-buddy-prod
FIREBASE_CLIENT_ID=xxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=firebase-adminsdk-xxxxx@youtube-buddy-prod.iam.gserviceaccount.com
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nxxxxx\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=youtube-buddy-prod.appspot.com

# ── FILE STORAGE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
STORAGE_PROVIDER=firebase
STORAGE_CDN_URL=https://cdn.youtube-buddy.com
UPLOAD_DIR=/uploads
RENDER_DIR=/rendered
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_BYTES=10737418240

# ── APPLICATION CONFIGURATION ───────────────────────────────────────
ENVIRONMENT=production
DEBUG=False
API_PREFIX=/api/v1
API_V1_PREFIX=/api/v1
APP_NAME=YouTube Buddy Backend
BACKEND_HOST=https://api.youtube-buddy.com

# ── SECURITY: JWT Tokens ────────────────────────────────────────────
JWT_SECRET=GenerateNewSecureTokenForProduction
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60

# ── LOGGING & MONITORING ────────────────────────────────────────────
SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxxx@sentry.io/xxxxx
DATADOG_API_KEY=xxxxx
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
